  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m D\xF6rtl\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nMaviliklerine kan\u0131p \xF6zg\xFCr bir ruhla \xE7ok
    derin sulara yelken a\xE7m\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Umutlar\u0131n korkmaman\u0131,
    duraksamaman\u0131 ve ilerlemeye devam etmeni s\xF6ylemi\u015F. Bunu yaparken
    elbette bedelleri olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 da biliyordun, \xF6yle de\u011Fil
    mi {{isim}}? Hepsi gerekli miydi bilinmez, birtak\u0131m maddi kay\u0131plar
    vermi\u015Fsin. Ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131k ihtimalinin artt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn zamanlarda bile risk almay\u0131 s\xFCrd\xFCrm\xFC\u015Fs\xFCn.
    \u015Eans\u0131n\u0131 bu kadar zorlaman belki de \u015Fart de\u011Fildi. Her
    durumda istedi\u011Fini elde edemesen de, u\u011Fra\u015F\u0131n boyunca kendini
    yenilemi\u015F, geli\u015Ftirmi\u015F ve \xE7ok de\u011Ferli deneyimler elde
    etmi\u015Fsin. Ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n tecr\xFCbe, senden kopup giden her
    \u015Feye ra\u011Fmen yan\u0131na kar kalm\u0131\u015F."
